OL,3,GNEWSAChannel swimmers complete relay in
OL,4,Abathing pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parish council chairman from Suffolk
OL,7,Fwas among a group of intrepid swimmers
OL,8,Fforced to abandon a cross-Channel
OL,9,Fchallenge and complete it in an outdoor
OL,10,Fbathing pool.
OL,12,FJohn Bauer, 66, chairman of Barnham
OL,13,FParish Council, was part of the Odyssey
OL,14,F2 relay squad bidding to swim the new
OL,15,F100km (62-mile) route between Alderney
OL,16,Fin the Channel Islands and Swanage in
OL,17,FDorset.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
