OL,3,GNEWSAChannel swimmers complete relay in
OL,4,Abathing pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, a "significant mechanical
OL,7,Fproblem" with the pilot boat, which
OL,8,Fsails alongside the swimmers, meant the
OL,9,Fchallenge was called off and completed
OL,10,Fin a tidal pool at the last minute.
OL,12,F"To say we were deflated would be an
OL,13,Funderstatement. It was disbelief
OL,14,Freally," Bauer said.
